# n was assigned `(rx_len < max_len) ? rx_len : max_len`. The condition is
# true when max_len < rx_len (caller buffer smaller than queued bytes), so
# the check correctly guards the memmove. Surfaced after promoting
# ra_net_tcp internals to external linkage for MC/DC test access.
